            %li
              %p
                The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+gluing"} double gluing
                construction relative to a pair of functors
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
